Chapter: DiagVmxGuest
  cites Foreword chapter Console
  cites Foreword chapter Maybe

 The guest the `vmx` stage launches: it speaks the desk compiler's serial
 protocol (`VmCompile.codex`, a mode line, the source, EOT in; `SIZE:<n>`, a
 newline and n bytes out) and answers with the source line it was sent, so a
 correct echo proves both directions of the guest's serial port.

Section: Body

  line-text : Maybe Text -> Text
  line-text (m) = when m is Just (t) -> t is None -> ""

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    mode <- read-line
    src <- read-line
    print-line-uni ("SIZE:" & show (text-length (line-text src)))
    print-line-uni (line-text src)
  end

